{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0152o7Wa5reTjqPZQf7MWrsk","type":"tool_result","content":"diff --git a/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd b/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\nindex 696ec05..a58e09d 100644\n--- a/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\n+++ b/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\n@@ -1 +1,37 @@\n extends Area3D\n+\n+## Launch speed applied along the pad's local up direction. Far stronger than the player's own jump.\n+@export var launch_force := 26.0\n+## How much the mushroom cap squashes down at the instant of launch.\n+@export var squash_scale := Vector3(1.3, 0.55, 1.3)\n+## Duration of the initial squash-down.\n+@export var squash_duration := 0.06\n+## Duration of the elastic rebound back to resting shape.\n+@export var rebound_duration := 0.5\n+\n+@onready var _mushroom: Node3D = %mushroom\n+\n+var _bounce_tween: Tween\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tbody_entered.connect(_on_body_entered)\n+\n+\n+func _on_body_entered(body: Node3D) -> void:\n+\tif not body is Player:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar launch_direction := global_transform.basis.y.normalized()\n+\tbody.launch(launch_direction * launch_force)\n+\t_play_bounce_animation()\n+\n+\n+func _play_bounce_animation() -> void:\n+\tif _bounce_tween:\n+\t\t_bounce_tween.kill()\n+\n+\t_mushroom.scale = Vector3.ONE\n+\t_bounce_tween = create_tween()\n+\t_bounce_tween.tween_property(_mushroom, \"scale\", squash_scale, squash_duration).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_SINE).set_ease(Tween.EASE_OUT)\n+\t_bounce_tween.tween_property(_mushroom, \"scale\", Vector3.ONE, rebound_duration).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_ELASTIC).set_ease(Tween.EASE_OUT)\ndiff --git a/player/player.gd b/player/player.gd\nindex a29ca01..67b2c2b 100644\n--- a/player/player.gd\n+++ b/player/player.gd\n@@ -246,6 +246,12 @@ func damage(_impact_point: Vector3, force: Vector3) -> void:\n \tlose_coins()\n \n \n+## Overrides current velocity with a launch, discarding any prior momentum (e.g. jump pads).\n+func launch(new_velocity: Vector3) -> void:\n+\tvelocity = new_velocity\n+\t_character_skin.jump()\n+\n+\n func _orient_character_to_direction(direction: Vector3, delta: float) -> void:\n \tvar left_axis := Vector3.UP.cross(direction)\n \tvar rotation_basis := Basis(left_axis, Vector3.UP, direction).get_rotation_quaternion()","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64e170b8-c924-4dec-9779-7a9a1aad7938","uuid":"82545fd7-e365-4090-8eaa-f24b83777723","timestamp":"2026-07-12T23:04:09.077Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"diff --git a/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd b/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\nindex 696ec05..a58e09d 100644\n--- a/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\n+++ b/jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd\n@@ -1 +1,37 @@\n extends Area3D\n+\n+## Launch speed applied along the pad's local up direction. Far stronger than the player's own jump.\n+@export var launch_force := 26.0\n+## How much the mushroom cap squashes down at the instant of launch.\n+@export var squash_scale := Vector3(1.3, 0.55, 1.3)\n+## Duration of the initial squash-down.\n+@export var squash_duration := 0.06\n+## Duration of the elastic rebound back to resting shape.\n+@export var rebound_duration := 0.5\n+\n+@onready var _mushroom: Node3D = %mushroom\n+\n+var _bounce_tween: Tween\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tbody_entered.connect(_on_body_entered)\n+\n+\n+func _on_body_entered(body: Node3D) -> void:\n+\tif not body is Player:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar launch_direction := global_transform.basis.y.normalized()\n+\tbody.launch(launch_direction * launch_force)\n+\t_play_bounce_animation()\n+\n+\n+func _play_bounce_animation() -> void:\n+\tif _bounce_tween:\n+\t\t_bounce_tween.kill()\n+\n+\t_mushroom.scale = Vector3.ONE\n+\t_bounce_tween = create_tween()\n+\t_bounce_tween.tween_property(_mushroom, \"scale\", squash_scale, squash_duration).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_SINE).set_ease(Tween.EASE_OUT)\n+\t_bounce_tween.tween_property(_mushroom, \"scale\", Vector3.ONE, rebound_duration).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_ELASTIC).set_ease(Tween.EASE_OUT)\ndiff --git a/player/player.gd b/player/player.gd\nindex a29ca01..67b2c2b 100644\n--- a/player/player.gd\n+++ b/player/player.gd\n@@ -246,6 +246,12 @@ func damage(_impact_point: Vector3, force: Vector3) -> void:\n \tlose_coins()\n \n \n+## Overrides current velocity with a launch, discarding any prior momentum (e.g. jump pads).\n+func launch(new_velocity: Vector3) -> void:\n+\tvelocity = new_velocity\n+\t_character_skin.jump()\n+\n+\n func _orient_character_to_direction(direction: Vector3, delta: float) -> void:\n \tvar left_axis := Vector3.UP.cross(direction)\n \tvar rotation_basis := Basis(left_axis, Vector3.UP, direction).get_rotation_quaternion()","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CcxzutnUhek5tt34AkHwM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Summary of what was done:\n\n**`jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd`** — the Area3D now listens for `body_entered`:\n- Filters to `body is Player` only (enemies/projectiles/boxes pass through untouched — req. 6)\n- Launches along `global_transform.basis.y` (pad's local up), so a flat pad launches straight up and a tilted pad launches up-and-outward (req. 4)\n- Calls `body.launch(...)`, which replaces velocity entirely — no leftover momentum, real physics-driven motion via `CharacterBody3D.velocity` + `move_and_slide` (reqs. 1–3)\n- Triggers a squash-then-elastic-rebound `Tween` on the mushroom mesh's scale each time, killing/restarting any in-flight tween on re-contact (req. 5)\n\n**`player/player.gd`** — added a small public `launch()` method (mirrors the existing `damage()` pattern) that overwrites velocity and plays the jump animation state.\n\nVerified with a headless Godot test harness (instantiating the real scenes, not mocks) that: contact reliably triggers the launch, velocity becomes exactly the pad's launch vector regardless of prior momentum, and existing air-control/gravity code (untouched) continues to apply afterward. Temporary test scripts were deleted; only the two intended files changed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1124,"cache_read_input_tokens":84820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1124,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64e170b8-c924-4dec-9779-7a9a1aad7938","uuid":"e7eb8fde-b6af-4704-999b-367b911d44b6","request_id":"req_011CcxzusVbM63y93jKF7jwx"}
